{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please note: You are playing a beta version. Certain systems are incomplete, and features may be adjusted or expanded prior to launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skull Port is a faithful digital adaptation of a popular board game. Players take on the roles of rival captains seeking dominance through dice-based gameplay and strategic Influence token placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll the dice &amp; gain influence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round begins with a Yahtzee-style dice roll, followed by careful manipulation and strategic positioning on Ships' or Port positions. Players can push each other off ships, claim bonuses, and adapt to the changing Fleet Bonus Cards introduced at different stages of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902530/extras/259a33a36d93ebc190be541a5ff13958.poster.avif?t=1761294748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902530/extras/259a33a36d93ebc190be541a5ff13958.webm?t=1761294748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With a 10-round structure and scoring phases, Skull Port captures the feel of a board game in digital form. It\u2019s ideal for players who enjoy thoughtful strategy, turn-based gameplay, and tabletop-style experiences on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a strategic pirate game that combines dice rolling, Influence token placement, and card bonuses into an exciting digital board game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the roll outcomes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your rivals off ships to overtake their positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Captain Bonus Cards for powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing Fleet Bonus Cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points at the end of each stage!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome Aboard!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/695d52b006d49eab0e8f37fc26cd8098dd8ca61e.jpg"},{"name":"Raise the Sails","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/7928933a4787a63eb6cf968e796f7d2639d9918e.jpg"},{"name":"Earned Your Sea Legs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/6990df0916e7db5353caec9fe923e11075fa5bea.jpg"},{"name":"First Taste of Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/85139ce3db15898225bf3a7b3c4e67e2b396a24e.jpg"},{"name":"Granted the Jolly Roger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/e79a2e5c3db69a3054684d40e2e29750994b807a.jpg"},{"name":"Too Much Booty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/68eaf933b4fcfabd05df6260fa65412e35be84a9.jpg"},{"name":"Spend It Like You Stole It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/cbac9adbfe0df7670a3bf10ee7a05e823d611415.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/bf5cebba3b632da82779a9e9e0ad0e2372fed395.jpg"},{"name":"The Rigged Roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3902530/7ed189d66ea9d0108afcb5cca74e628359d4d504.jpg"},{"name":"I'll Take The Lot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc